      "description_html": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"b68c167f-a362-4c62-b522-388daf0a85d2\"><strong>목적:</strong> 화면설계서가 식별한 신규 API 8건 구현(6.2).</p><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"2bcc821c-3165-478b-8cdc-bf8fad20e297\"><strong>범위:</strong> GET /servers(인벤토리·스냅샷 상태), GET /sessions(목록·검색), GET /events/recent(SSE 끊김 보충 겸용), GET /attacklab/scenarios(구현 여부 포함), GET /policies/{id}/stats(발동·dry-run 통계), POST /events/{id}/reveal(원문 열람+감사 기록), POST /sessions/{id}/export(리포트), PUT /servers/{id}·/settings.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y) tight\" data-id=\"46004397-0ac7-4fa5-92f1-68daf801421e\" data-tight=\"true\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"c3ce8c03-085e-48c7-a340-67edd8b32922\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"ec5e37dd-f27f-426d-bfd2-6432e9aae164\">M 우선순위 4건(servers/sessions/recent/scenarios) 우선 완료</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"d7476e11-5f69-4041-a202-65aa648afe76\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"03fa99a3-1fba-474c-8055-7183bf780f9c\">reveal 호출이 감사 로그에 열람 기록을 남김(NFR-04)</p></li></ul>",
